thread 0 gives the caller's slot: 0x00000001
the caller's UID gives the caller's slot: 0x00000001
key 1 of thread 0 is the next word: 0x00000001
the thread manager call gives another thread a slot: 0x00000001
another thread gives that thread's slot: 0x00000001
an unknown UID gives NULL: 0x00000001
key 256 gives NULL: 0x00000001
key -1 gives NULL: 0x00000001
DONE
